# CLAUDE.md

Guidance for Claude Code on this Windows workstation.

## MCP / integrations
- Prefer the Composio plugin for cross-app tools after `/plugin install composio-mcp@composio`.
- Check MCP status before relying on MCP-dependent features.
- Do NOT set ANTHROPIC_API_KEY when using Max subscription `/login` OAuth (API key overrides subscription).

## Agents
Specialized agents live in `~/.claude/agents/` (frontend, backend, review, QA, deployment, etc.).
Use the Task tool / agent-organizer for multi-domain work.

## Skills
User skills live in `~/.claude/skills/` including composio-fullstack-pipeline, consolidate-memory, and document tooling skills.

## Shell notes (Windows)
- Prefer PowerShell 7 (`pwsh`) or Git Bash when shell tools need Unix-like behavior.
- Git is installed at `C:\Program Files\Git\`.
